{"name": "TETHER BRAWL", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TETHER BRAWL is an action-packed, top-down, 2-player game where co-operation is optional.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE THE ROBOT ONSLAUGHT </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play various game modes, where players tackle relentless robot waves. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From varied arenas to character uniqueness and different enemies, every match is exciting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand united against the mechanical onslaught, or risk a crushing defeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/1fe4b7cd3f370de20cc698ae6036ee36.poster.avif?t=1756142085\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/1fe4b7cd3f370de20cc698ae6036ee36.webm?t=1756142085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/1fe4b7cd3f370de20cc698ae6036ee36.mp4?t=1756142085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER YOUR MOVES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every character, from Jeremiah's bat-swinging might to Beccia's sharp throwing, demands skill. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfectly timing your skills and mastering abilities is essential.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the charge and dominate the arena with calculated moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/793705896cf801791bc17fd1005a2978.poster.avif?t=1756142085\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/793705896cf801791bc17fd1005a2978.webm?t=1756142085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/793705896cf801791bc17fd1005a2978.mp4?t=1756142085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRUST IS OPTIONAL </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CO-OP mode emphasizes teamwork and synergy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The competitive VERSUS mode offers both strategy and betrayal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense PARTY matches are a balancing act of trust and competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/327f09fb1d08a9a11534ea3cd2e15fb3.poster.avif?t=1756142085\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/327f09fb1d08a9a11534ea3cd2e15fb3.webm?t=1756142085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/327f09fb1d08a9a11534ea3cd2e15fb3.mp4?t=1756142085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITH FRIENDS ONLINE USING STEAM'S REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"142\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/4ca871d827caa6dc58b38d7aea838aa3.avif?t=1756142085\" width=\"598\